    "description": "Welcome to the Houston Texans App, your main access point for tickets, exclusive giveaways, news, and Texans content!\r\n\r\nUse the Texans app to make every day feel like gameday:\r\n\r\n- Mobile ticketing with personalized navigation;\r\n- Exclusive giveaways from the Texans and our partners;\r\n- Custom App Icons, including our H logo and the H-Town Blue bullhead logo;\r\n- The latest Ticketmaster updates for a smooth gameday experience;\r\n- Mobile ordering opportunities for specific seating locations, and easy-access merch and concessions discounts for Season Ticket Members!",
